Subject: [PATCH] net: pcs: mtk: propagate failures and balance clock, PHY and reset ownership

Retain the selected modes and native register sequences, but track
requested, enabled and successfully configured states separately. Keep
carrier down on failed configuration or invalid status; retry no more
than once a second while enabled. Handle clock/PHY/reset/regmap errors
and shared reset accounting, and avoid devm double free and phandle
reference leaks. Honor both individual polarity flags together.

